      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "My thinking is that the ToS for Udon-powered world moderation as currently written was well-suited before worlds could have persistence, but now that worlds can be powered by persistence, it is time to re-evaluate the ToS and create rules that account for cheaters able to misbehave in one instance and carry that result with them into new instances where the ToS does not currently allow creators to do anything about it.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
